## Two things, and they are not the same thing

The **geometry** is the U.S. Census Bureau's cartographic boundary files at
1:10,000,000 — a work of the United States Government, and therefore in the
public domain. Nobody licenses it to anybody.

The **package** that simplified, projected and packaged that geometry is
